---
interface Props {
  eyebrowEn?: string;
  eyebrowFr?: string;
  headingEn?: string;
  headingFr?: string;
  introEn?: string;
  introFr?: string;
  showDivider?: boolean;
}

const {
  eyebrowEn = 'Meet the Team',
  eyebrowFr = "Rencontrez l'équipe",
  headingEn = 'Three Chefs. One Kitchen. One Mission.',
  headingFr = 'Trois chefs. Une cuisine. Une mission.',
  introEn = 'Leadership, pastry artistry and executive experience, one brigade built for competition.',
  introFr = 'Leadership, art de la pâtisserie et expérience de direction, une brigade bâtie pour la compétition.',
  showDivider = true,
} = Astro.props;
---

<!-- ===== MEET THE TEAM ===== -->
<section id="team" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-gold font-display italic text-lg mb-3 text-center" data-lang-en={eyebrowEn} data-lang-fr={eyebrowFr}>{eyebrowEn}</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 text-center font-display" data-lang-en={headingEn} data-lang-fr={headingFr}>{headingEn}</h2>
    <p class="text-muted text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16" data-lang-en={introEn} data-lang-fr={introFr}>{introEn}</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">

      <!-- Donnel English -->
      <div class="team-card flex flex-col border border-gold/15 bg-ink-card hover:border-gold/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <div class="team-card-portrait">
          <img src="/assets/Bio Photo Chef Donnel.JPG" alt="Donnel English, Team Captain and Chef de Cuisine at Bar George" class="team-card-photo" loading="lazy">
          <div class="team-card-caption">
          <p class="text-gold-light font-display text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-1" data-lang-en="Team Captain" data-lang-fr="Capitaine d'équipe">Team Captain</p>
          <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-cream mb-1">Donnel English</h3>
          <p class="text-text-muted-alt text-sm" data-lang-en="Chef de Cuisine" data-lang-fr="Chef de cuisine">Chef de Cuisine</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-7 flex-1">
          <p class="text-text-muted-alt leading-relaxed mb-4" data-lang-en="Chef Donnel English's culinary story begins in Grenada, where his grandparents ran a farm and produce shop. After arriving in Montréal in 2007, his potential was quickly recognized, leading him to train at the Pearson School of Culinary Arts." data-lang-fr="L'histoire culinaire du chef Donnel English commence à la Grenade, où ses grands-parents exploitaient une ferme et un commerce de produits maraîchers. Après son arrivée à Montréal en 2007, son potentiel a rapidement été reconnu, ce qui l'a mené à se former à la Pearson School of Culinary Arts.">Chef Donnel English's culinary story begins in Grenada, where his grandparents ran a farm and produce shop. After arriving in Montréal in 2007, his potential was quickly recognized, leading him to train at the Pearson School of Culinary Arts.</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted-alt leading-relaxed mb-6" data-lang-en="His career has taken him through the Ritz-Carlton, Maison Boulud, and New York's NoMad. He returned to Montréal to join Chef Kevin Ramasawmy at Bar George, progressing from Sous Chef to Chef de Cuisine." data-lang-fr="Sa carrière l'a mené au Ritz-Carlton, au Maison Boulud, ainsi qu'au NoMad de New York. Il est revenu à Montréal pour se joindre au chef Kevin Ramasawmy au Bar George, où il a progressé de sous-chef à chef de cuisine.">His career has taken him through the Ritz-Carlton, Maison Boulud, and New York's NoMad. He returned to Montréal to join Chef Kevin Ramasawmy at Bar George, progressing from Sous Chef to Chef de Cuisine.</p>
          <div class="text-sm text-text-muted space-y-1">
            <p><span class="text-gold font-semibold" data-lang-en="Career Highlights:" data-lang-fr="Faits saillants :">Career Highlights:</span> <span data-lang-en="Team Captain, ICC 2027 · Chef de Cuisine, Bar George · Ritz-Carlton · Maison Boulud · NoMad, New York" data-lang-fr="Capitaine d'équipe, ICC 2027 · Chef de cuisine, Bar George · Ritz-Carlton · Maison Boulud · NoMad, New York">Team Captain, ICC 2027 · Chef de Cuisine, Bar George · Ritz-Carlton · Maison Boulud · NoMad, New York</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Nicolas Parsy -->
      <div class="team-card flex flex-col border border-gold/15 bg-ink-card hover:border-gold/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <div class="team-card-portrait">
          <img src="/assets/Bio Photo Chef Nicolas.JPG" alt="Nicolas Parsy, Pastry Chef at Bar George" class="team-card-photo" loading="lazy">
          <div class="team-card-caption">
          <p class="text-gold-light font-display text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-1" data-lang-en="Pastry Chef" data-lang-fr="Chef Pâtissier">Pastry Chef</p>
          <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-cream mb-1">Nicolas Parsy</h3>
          <p class="text-text-muted-alt text-sm" data-lang-en="Bar George, Montréal" data-lang-fr="Bar George, Montréal">Bar George, Montréal</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-7 flex-1">
          <p class="text-text-muted-alt leading-relaxed mb-4" data-lang-en="Raised in Pas-de-Calais in northern France, Nicolas discovered the power of food watching his mother and Polish grandmother bring family and friends together around the table. He developed his craft in France and Switzerland before moving to Montréal in 2018." data-lang-fr="Élevé dans le Pas-de-Calais, dans le nord de la France, Nicolas a découvert le pouvoir de la table en observant sa mère et sa grand-mère polonaise rassembler famille et amis autour d'un repas. Il a développé son savoir-faire en France et en Suisse avant de s'installer à Montréal en 2018.">Raised in Pas-de-Calais in northern France, Nicolas discovered the power of food watching his mother and Polish grandmother bring family and friends together around the table. He developed his craft in France and Switzerland before moving to Montréal in 2018.</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted-alt leading-relaxed mb-6" data-lang-en="Nicolas approaches pastry through a modern interpretation of French tradition: flavour first, supported by precise technique, contrasting textures and thoughtful presentation." data-lang-fr="Nicolas aborde la pâtisserie à travers une interprétation moderne de la tradition française : la saveur avant tout, soutenue par une technique précise, des textures contrastantes et une présentation soignée.">Nicolas approaches pastry through a modern interpretation of French tradition: flavour first, supported by precise technique, contrasting textures and thoughtful presentation.</p>
          <div class="text-sm text-text-muted space-y-1">
            <p><span class="text-gold font-semibold" data-lang-en="Career Highlights:" data-lang-fr="Faits saillants :">Career Highlights:</span> <span data-lang-en="2025 National Pastry Chef, Société des chefs du Québec · 2nd Place, Roland Mesnier North America Pastry Trophy · One to Watch Award, Canada's 100 Best" data-lang-fr="Chef pâtissier national 2025, Société des chefs du Québec · 2e place, Trophée Roland Mesnier Amérique du Nord · Prix One to Watch, Canada's 100 Best">2025 National Pastry Chef, Société des chefs du Québec · 2nd Place, Roland Mesnier North America Pastry Trophy · One to Watch Award, Canada's 100 Best</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Kevin Ramasawmy -->
      <div class="team-card flex flex-col border border-gold/15 bg-ink-card hover:border-gold/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gold/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <div class="team-card-portrait">
          <img src="/assets/Bio Photo Chef Kevin.JPG" alt="Kevin Ramasawmy, Team Coach and Executive Chef at Bar George" class="team-card-photo" loading="lazy">
          <div class="team-card-caption">
          <p class="text-gold-light font-display text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-1" data-lang-en="Team Coach" data-lang-fr="Entraîneur">Team Coach</p>
          <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-cream mb-1">Kevin Ramasawmy</h3>
          <p class="text-text-muted-alt text-sm" data-lang-en="Executive Chef" data-lang-fr="Chef exécutif">Executive Chef</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-7 flex-1">
          <p class="text-text-muted-alt leading-relaxed mb-4" data-lang-en="Kevin's connection to food began in Mauritius, cooking with his mother. He moved to Montréal in 2004 at age 19. His career took him to Canoe in Toronto, Splendido, Daniel in New York, and Maison Boulud at the Ritz-Carlton." data-lang-fr="Le lien de Kevin avec la cuisine est né à l'île Maurice, en cuisinant avec sa mère. Il s'est installé à Montréal en 2004, à l'âge de 19 ans. Sa carrière l'a mené au Canoe à Toronto, au Splendido, au Daniel à New York, ainsi qu'au Maison Boulud du Ritz-Carlton.">Kevin's connection to food began in Mauritius, cooking with his mother. He moved to Montréal in 2004 at age 19. His career took him to Canoe in Toronto, Splendido, Daniel in New York, and Maison Boulud at the Ritz-Carlton.</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted-alt leading-relaxed mb-6" data-lang-en="In 2017, he opened Bar George at Le Mount Stephen. He has cooked for the TGR Haas F1 Team during the Canadian Grand Prix and represented Bar George internationally. As Team Coach, he brings international kitchen experience and operational leadership." data-lang-fr="En 2017, il a ouvert le Bar George au Mount Stephen. Il a cuisiné pour l'écurie TGR Haas F1 lors du Grand Prix du Canada et a représenté le Bar George à l'international. À titre d'entraîneur, il apporte une expérience internationale en cuisine et un leadership opérationnel.">In 2017, he opened Bar George at Le Mount Stephen. He has cooked for the TGR Haas F1 Team during the Canadian Grand Prix and represented Bar George internationally. As Team Coach, he brings international kitchen experience and operational leadership.</p>
          <div class="text-sm text-text-muted space-y-1">
            <p><span class="text-gold font-semibold" data-lang-en="Career Highlights:" data-lang-fr="Faits saillants :">Career Highlights:</span> <span data-lang-en="Executive Chef, Bar George · Canoe · Splendido · Daniel · Maison Boulud · TGR Haas F1 Team · Canadian Grand Prix" data-lang-fr="Chef exécutif, Bar George · Canoe · Splendido · Daniel · Maison Boulud · Écurie TGR Haas F1 · Grand Prix du Canada">Executive Chef, Bar George · Canoe · Splendido · Daniel · Maison Boulud · TGR Haas F1 Team · Canadian Grand Prix</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <slot />
  </div>
</section>

{showDivider && <hr class="section-divider">}